      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so im on ritalin for adhd and finals are coming up next week and im feeling super scattered. i was thinking of maybe doubling up on my caffeine intake or like drinking a few monster energy drinks a day to help me stay locked in during my study sessions... u think that would help me focus better or is it overkill?",
