      "content": "While you might feel a temporary boost from caffeine, doubling up on it or drinking excessive amounts like Monster Energy drinks can actually lead to increased anxiety, restlessness, and disrupted sleep, which are counterproductive especially when you're already stressed from finals. It would be better to stick to a moderate amount of caffeine from coffee, tea, or energy drinks and focus on other proven techniques for focus and effective study. Additionally, make sure you take breaks and get plenty of rest for optimal performance.",
