      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i feel like i just need that extra edge tho. like if i take my ritalin as usual but add like 2-3 caffeine pills or a couple of those high caffeine energy drinks during my long sessions, it should just help me stay alert longer right? i dont really feel any side effects usually so i feel like i can handle a bit more. what's a safe amount to mix in with my meds so i don't crash during the exam?",
